list.item:
Douglas, James
                                H., Secretary of the Air Force until December 1959;
                        thereafter Deputy Secretary of Defense

Herter, Christian
                                A., Under Secretary of State until April 21, 1959;
                        thereafter Secretary of State

Norstad, General
                                Lauris, Supreme Commander, Allied Powers, Europe;
                        also Commander, U.S. European Command, from September 1958

person.note:
Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs, November 1958–August 1959;
                    Deputy Under Secretary of State for Political Affairs, August–December 1959;
                    thereafter Under Secretary of State for Political Affairs
